    "question": "Form the differential equation of the family of curves $y = A\\cos x + B\\sin x$. [3 marks]",
    "solutionSteps": [
      "**Step 1: Differentiate Once**",
      "$\\frac{dy}{dx} = -A\\sin x + B\\cos x$",
      "**Step 2: Differentiate Twice**",
