      "**Step 3: Eliminate Constants**",
      "$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = -(A\\cos x + B\\sin x) = -y$",
      "$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} + y = 0$."
    ],
    "finalAnswer": "d²y/dx² + y = 0",
